# Dropbox OAuth App Key
# 1. https://www.dropbox.com/developers/apps → Create app
#    - Scoped access / App folder
#    - Permissions: files.content.read, files.content.write
# 2. Settings → OAuth2 → Redirect URIs: add your app URL (e.g. http://localhost:5173/)
# 3. Copy the App key
VITE_DROPBOX_CLIENT_ID=your_app_key_here

# Google Drive OAuth Client ID (Client Secret is NOT needed — PKCE flow)
# 1. https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Library → enable Google Drive API
# 2. OAuth consent screen → External / Scopes: drive.file / add yourself as a test user
# 3. Credentials → Create OAuth client ID → Desktop app
#    (Desktop app type supports PKCE without client_secret — Web application type requires it)
#    - Authorized redirect URIs: http://localhost (covers all ports)
# 4. Copy the Client ID
VITE_GDRIVE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_oauth_client_id
